sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OP as Human Tester
    participant AC as Agent Core (LangGraph)
    participant SG as Scope Guard
    participant SB as Docker Sandbox
    participant DB as State & Graph DB
    participant VR as Verifier AI

    Note over AC,DB: 1. PLAN & ORIENT
    AC->>DB: Query current assets & open ports
    DB-->>AC: Discovered attack surface
    AC->>AC: Select next highest-yield target & tool

    Note over AC,SG: 2. SAFETY & SCOPE CHECK
    AC->>SG: Intercept target IP / domain
    alt Out-of-Scope Target
        SG-->>AC: HARD BLOCK (Execution Aborted)
    else Intrusive Action
        SG->>OP: Prompt 1-Click Approval
        OP-->>AC: Approved by Tester
    else Safe Passive Action
        SG-->>AC: Allowed (Pre-Approved)
    end

    Note over AC,SB: 3. EXECUTE & PARSE
    AC->>SB: Run tool (Nmap / Nuclei / ffuf)
    SB-->>AC: Raw tool output (JSON/XML)
    AC->>DB: Parse structured facts (Hosts, Services)

    Note over AC,VR: 4. DUAL-AGENT VERIFICATION
    opt Potential Vulnerability Suspected
        AC->>VR: Submit target & vulnerability claim
        Note over VR: Isolated context (no prior bias)
        VR->>SB: Execute independent PoC reproduction
        SB-->>VR: PoC response
        alt Reproduced Successfully
            VR->>DB: Record CONFIRMED Finding (+ Evidence)
        else Unconfirmed / False Alarm
            VR->>OP: Flag for Manual Review
        end
    end
